Gateway Youth exists to reach the next generation with the gospel and help students grow into lifelong followers of Jesus. Our heart is to see lives transformed in a way that impacts our community, our schools, and the nations. We desire to come alongside parents as we raise up disciples who love Jesus and love people.

There are several opportunities throughout the week for students to connect, grow, and have fun!

Sunday Mornings | 9:00 AM - 10:00 AM · Sunday School: Students gather to study God's Word, grow in their faith, and learn what it means to follow Jesus. Sunday Evenings | 4:00 PM - 6:00 PM · Youth Group: Middle and High School students come together for games, hanging out, and fellowship, followed by diving deeper into God's Word in small groups and building meaningful relationships with one another. Wednesday Evenings | 4:00 PM - 6:00 PM · A relaxed, informal time for students to come hang out, connect, and spend time together. Whether they need a place to work on homework, enjoy some study hall time, play games, or simply fellowship with friends, there's room for both!

We'd love for your student to be part of what God is doing through Gateway Students. They have a place here!
